  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 716.04 Filtration and Disinfection Required. The O/O of a PWS subject to this part shall comply with the filtration and disinfection requirements of 40 CFR §§ 141.70-73.\n\nSource. #9620, eff 1-1-10; ss by #12533, eff 6-1-18",
